sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant E as Extinguisher Service
    participant N as Notification Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C,DB: 1. Authentication Flow
    C->>F: Enter credentials
    F->>G: POST /auth/login
    G->>A: Forward login request
    A->>DB: Verify credentials
    DB-->>A: User found
    A-->>G: JWT tokens + user info
    G-->>F: Auth response
    F->>F: Store tokens in localStorage

    Note over C,DB: 2. Customer Requests Inspection
    C->>F: Click "Request Inspection"
    F->>G: POST /extinguishers/:id/inspections<br/>(JWT in header)
    G->>G: Verify JWT token
    G->>E: Forward request
    E->>DB: INSERT inspection_request
    E->>N: Trigger notification
    N->>DB: INSERT notification
    N-->>E: Notification sent
    E-->>G: Inspection created
    G-->>F: Success response
    F-->>C: Show success message

    Note over C,DB: 3. Inspector Performs Inspection
    participant I as Inspector
    I->>F: View inspection requests
    F->>G: GET /extinguishers/inspections
    G->>E: Fetch inspections
    E->>DB: SELECT inspections<br/>WHERE status = PENDING
    DB-->>E: Return inspections
    E-->>G: Inspection list
    G-->>F: Response
    F-->>I: Display requests

    I->>F: Start inspection
    F->>G: PATCH /inspections/:id/start
    G->>E: Update status
    E->>DB: UPDATE status = IN_PROGRESS
    E-->>G: Updated
    G-->>F: Success
    F-->>I: Show form

    I->>F: Submit report (condition, actions, result)
    F->>G: POST /inspections/:id/report
    G->>E: Save report
    E->>DB: UPDATE inspection<br/>status = COMPLETED_PENDING_ADMIN_REVIEW
    E->>N: Notify admin
    E-->>G: Report submitted
    G-->>F: Success
    F-->>I: Confirmation

    Note over C,DB: 4. Admin Reviews Inspection
    participant AD as Admin
    AD->>F: View pending reviews
    F->>G: GET /extinguishers/inspections?status=...
    G->>E: Fetch pending
    E->>DB: SELECT inspections
    DB-->>E: Return data
    E-->>G: Inspection list
    G-->>F: Response
    F-->>AD: Display reviews

    AD->>F: Approve/Reject
    F->>G: PATCH /inspections/:id/review
    G->>E: Update review status
    E->>DB: UPDATE status = APPROVED
    E->>N: Notify customer
    E-->>G: Updated
    G-->>F: Success
    F-->>AD: Confirmation

    Note over C,DB: 5. Admin Generates Report
    participant R as Report Service
    AD->>F: Click "Download Report"
    F->>G: GET /reports/compliance-summary?format=pdf
    G->>R: Forward request
    R->>E: GET extinguishers data
    E->>DB: SELECT extinguishers
    DB-->>E: Data
    E-->>R: Extinguisher data
    R->>E: GET inspections data
    E-->>R: Inspection data
    R->>E: GET maintenance data
    E-->>R: Maintenance data
    R->>R: Generate PDF
    R-->>G: PDF buffer
    G-->>F: File download
    F-->>AD: Download starts

    Note over C,DB: 6. Background Cron Job
    participant CR as Cron Scheduler
    CR->>E: Check expiry dates
    E->>DB: SELECT extinguishers<br/>WHERE expiry_date <= NOW() + 90 days
    DB-->>E: Expiring units
    E->>DB: UPDATE status = EXPIRING_SOON/EXPIRED
    E->>N: Send expiry notifications
    N->>DB: INSERT notifications
    N->>N: Send emails/SMS
    N-->>E: Complete
